5031	5200	He was elected to Lambeth Council at a by-election in 1979 but stood down in 1982, disillusioned with the state of Labour politics during the leadership of Michael Foot.
5201	5373	Mandelson then worked from 1982 to 1985 as a television producer at London Weekend Television on Weekend World, where he formed a friendship with his superior John Birt.



